    "name": "UniBook Publisher - E2E Workflow",
    "description": "End-to-end workflow: author submits -> chief editor approves + assigns editor -> author adds and updates chapter -> editor finalizes text -> chief editor assigns designer -> designer uploads cover -> chief editor publishes -> author gets contract (polling) -> author verifies contract.",
